			["MbAvWarnTitle"] = "Antivirus may slow the clone",
			["MbSrcOnTarget"] = "The file you're writing is stored ON the drive you're about to erase — this would destroy the source file itself. Move it to another drive first.",
			["MbAvOfferDism"] = "{0} appears to be active. It scans every file the standard clone engine reads, which can make the clone crawl (it often looks stuck around WinSxS).\n\nDriveForge can clone with Microsoft's own engine (DISM) instead — antivirus does not slow it down, and you don't have to change anything in your antivirus.\n\n  •  Yes  —  use the Microsoft engine (recommended, fast)\n  •  No  —  use the standard engine anyway (may be very slow)\n  •  Cancel  —  stop\n\nUse the Microsoft engine?",
