			["AnLegendDel"] = "will be moved to the Recycle Bin (you can restore it)",
			["AnalyzeEmptyHint"] = "This shows what's filling your disk and the duplicate copies you can safely remove.\r\n\r\n1.  Pick a folder above and press Scan.\r\n2.  The map shows which sub-folders use the most space; the Largest files tab lists the biggest files.\r\n3.  Open the Duplicate files tab and click '[[AnalyzeKeepFirstButton]]' — the green row is kept, the red ones are extra copies.\r\n4.  Press '[[AnalyzeDeleteButton]]' — files go to the Recycle Bin, so you can restore them if needed.\r\n\r\nNothing on your PC is changed until you press Delete.",
